      "name": "Sync new/updated issue from Jira to Salesforce",
      "source_name": "Sync new/updated issue from Jira to Salesforce",
      "recipe_id": 72883400,
      "description": "**Who it is for:** Product/Project Managers\n\n**Business Context:** Enable sales and product teams to have real-time visibility into customer-reported issues and development progress. Better track and manage customer requests, and prioritize and address issues promptly.\n\n**Customize it your way:** You can replace Jira with other apps like Asana or Trello, and Salesforce with other CRMs of your choice like HubSpot or ZoHo CRM.\n\n**How it works:** \n\n1. A new issue is created in Jira.\n\n2. Workato searches for a matching case in Salesforce by Jira **summary**.\n\n3. Workato searches for a matching account in Salesforce by Jira **key**. If no matching account is found in Salesforce, Workato creates a new account.\n\n4. If no matching case is found in Salesforce, Workato creates a new case in Salesforce.\n\n5. If  matching case is found in Salesforce, Workato updates a case in Salesforce.",
